{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>!Dream</i> is not quite a game \u2014 more an <strong>interactive short film</strong> or <strong>experimental art piece</strong> you can walk through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ten-minute experience about <strong>guilt, memory, and the flickering line between sleep and waking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play a soldier, but the real war happens elsewhere \u2014 in the loops of thought, in the quiet, in what refuses to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created as an experiment in narrative and atmosphere.<br>No missions. No scores. Just a dream you can\u2019t quite leave.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4128010?t=1761600423","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128010/3b084f8bf800365ea27ec29c643e594a18c9f2be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761600423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128010/f5d7a9d58763a67df75227a46234f54f3db97d3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761600423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128010/f5d7a9d58763a67df75227a46234f54f3db97d3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761600423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>!Dream</i> is not quite a game \u2014 more an <strong>interactive short film</strong> or <strong>experimental art piece</strong> you can walk through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ten-minute experience about <strong>guilt, memory, and the flickering line between sleep and waking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play a soldier, but the real war happens elsewhere \u2014 in the loops of thought, in the quiet, in what refuses to fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created as an experiment in narrative and atmosphere.<br>No missions. No scores. Just a dream you can\u2019t q